OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AHacks, AI or just overdue updates - why
OL,4,Ahave there been so many outages?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere is no evidence to suggest this -
OL,7,Fbut they do tell us a lot about how the
OL,8,Fmodern tech world works, and where the
OL,9,Fvulnerabilities lie.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/18
