OL,3,AGrand Theft Auto 6 begins worldwide
OL,4,Arelease after 13-year wait - and the
OL,5,Aearly reviews are in
OL,6,
OL,7,FMany critics are praising it as
OL,8,F"exquisitely detailed" and "mature",
OL,9,Fthough some say the game is
OL,10,F"inconsistent" and large parts are
OL,11,F"boring"
OL,13,FThe crime game, where players can
OL,14,Fexplore a fictional US state called
OL,15,FLeonida, features the series' first
OL,16,Fplayable female protagonist in a 3D
OL,17,Fsetting
OL,19,FA New Zealand gamer has already
OL,20,Ffinished the introduction - here are
OL,21,Fhis first thoughts (spoiler in post!)
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/18
